    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 9th level, whenever you would be hit by an attack roll or an effect that would deal damage or impose a harmful effect to you, you can use your reaction to move up to your floating step speed, potentially avoiding the attack or effect.</p><p>You can use this feature once, being unable to do it again until you finish a long rest. You gain one additional use of this feature at 13th (for a total of 2) and 17th (for a total of 3) levels.</p><hr><p><em>Foundry note: \"floating step speed\" is interpreted as your current movement speed.</em></p>",
